msgid "Grant access to per-application traffic statistics. The 'apps' method is granted because the overview drills into a device to show what it is doing; it returns an aggregate per device and application from the live flow table. 'flows' remains ungranted: that is the per-connection table, with remote addresses and ports."
msgstr "授予访问按应用流量统计数据的权限。由于概览页面会深入查看设备以显示其活动，因此授予了“apps”方法；该方法根据实时流量表返回按设备和应用汇总的数据。“flows”方法仍未授权，因为它提供的是包含远程地址和端口的逐连接数据。"

