msgid "Start typing a device name, MAC address or IP to find it. Click a device to see what it is doing in the applications list above. Press Clear to see all devices again."
msgstr "输入设备名称、MAC 地址或 IP 即可查找设备。点击设备可在上方应用列表中查看其活动。点击“清除”可再次显示所有设备。"

msgid "Start typing an application or category name to show only that traffic, or click a category in the Categories panel. Prefix a word with a minus to exclude it instead, for example -netflix. Press Clear to see all traffic again."
msgstr "输入应用或分类名称以仅显示相应流量，也可点击“分类”面板中的分类。在词语前添加减号可将其排除，例如 -netflix。点击“清除”可再次显示全部流量。"

