msgstr "电信"

msgid "The AppFlow collector could not be reached over ubus, so there is no traffic data to show. Start the service and this page picks it up automatically."
msgstr "无法通过 ubus 连接到 AppFlow 采集器，因此没有可显示的流量数据。启动该服务后，此页面会自动获取数据。"

msgid "The daemon could not return details for this application: %s"
msgstr "守护进程未能返回该应用的详情：%s"

msgid "This application is no longer in the daemon's aggregate table; it may have been pruned since the table was last refreshed."
msgstr "该应用已不在守护进程的汇总表中；自上次刷新以来，该记录可能已被清理。"

msgid "This resets the per-application, per-device and per-category counters and time buckets. Live flow tracking continues uninterrupted, so the figures on this page simply start again from zero."
msgstr "此操作会重置按应用、按设备和按分类的计数器与时间分桶。实时流量跟踪不会中断，此页面上的数字只是重新从零开始计算。"

