msgid "appflowd is running, but this LuCI session was refused access to it over ubus (permission denied). This is an ACL problem, not a stopped service: confirm the luci-app-appflow ACL is installed and reload rpcd."
msgstr "appflowd 正在运行，但当前 LuCI 会话通过 ubus 访问它时被拒绝（权限不足）。这是 ACL 权限问题，而非服务未启动：请确认已安装 luci-app-appflow 的 ACL 并重新加载 rpcd。"

